  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Mec 306.03 Concurrent Hours of Relevant Field Experience For Apprentices and Trainees. Any registered licensed plumbing apprentice who is also a registered licensed fuel gas trainee may accrue their hours of relevant field experience concurrently.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15; ss by #13770, eff 12-10-23 (formerly Saf-Mec 306.05) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 300)",
